FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Office_Text_NicknamedWardenSlowpoke::
    .string "We nicknamed the\n"
    .string "Warden Slowpoke.\p"
    .string "That vacant look.\p"
    .string "He got that\n"
    .string "look the night\n"
    .string "he saw Nullveil.\p"
    .string "Before that he\n"
    .string "was very sharp.$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Office_Text_WardenIsVeryKnowledgeable::
    .string "Warden Slowpoke is\n"
    .string "knowledgeable about Pokemon.\p"
    .string "He has fossils\n"
    .string "of rare extinct Pokemon.\p"
    .string "He has one\n"
    .string "item that isn't\n"
    .string "a fossil.\p"
    .string "Won't say what.\p"
    .string "Keeps it in\n"
    .string "the west room.$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Office_Text_CouldntUnderstandWarden::
    .string "Warden came in\n"
    .string "but I couldn't\n"
    .string "understand him.\p"
    .string "Speech problem.\p"
    .string "Before the teeth\n"
    .string "he spoke clearly.\p"
    .string "Last thing he\n"
    .string "said clearly was\n"
    .string "one word.\p"
    .string "Nullveil.$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Office_Text_PrizeInSafariZone::
    .string "Warden is running\n"
    .string "a promotion campaign.\p"
    .string "Get to the\n"
    .string "farthest corner of\n"
    .string "the Safari Zone.\p"
    .string "You'll win a\n"
    .string "very convenient prize.\p"
    .string "The farthest corner\n"
    .string "has something else.\p"
    .string "Don't go at night.$"
